            "LocalizeJP": "油断した。戻ったら反省会ね、先生。",
            "LocalizeEN": "We let our guard down. We'll have a meeting about this when we're back, Sensei."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10022,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Hina_(Swimsuit)_Tactic_Defeat_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0063/ch0063_tactic_defeat_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "しくじった…。次は、必ず。",
            "LocalizeEN": "I messed up... Next time, definitely."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10022,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Hina_(Swimsuit)_Tactic_In_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0063/ch0063_tactic_in_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Sensei, your orders."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10022,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Hina_(Swimsuit)_Tactic_Victory_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0063/ch0063_tactic_victory_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "We had Sensei on our side. It's only natural we find our victory."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10022,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Hina_(Swimsuit)_Tactic_Victory_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0063/ch0063_tactic_victory_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "The operation was a success. It was a bit too easy to serve as training."
        },
        {
